rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7512-7518">く、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7518-7542"><rb>麥稈</rb><rt>むぎわら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7542-7551">をゆり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7551-7566"><rb>直</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7566-7587">して、そこで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7587-7605"><rb>左</rb><rt>ひだり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7605-7608">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7608-7638"><rb>佐賀町</rb><rt>さがちやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7638-7641">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7641-7656"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7656-7659">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7659-7674"><rb>入</rb><rt>はひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7674-7700">つたのであるが。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-7700-7754">さて、かうたゝずむうちにも、ぐわら</seg><choice source="#source-7754-7760"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-7760-7790">、ぐわらとすさまじい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7790-7805"><rb>音</rb><rt>おと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7805-7808">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7808-7820"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7820-7829">てて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7829-7862"><rb>貨物車</rb><rt>くわもつしや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7862-7865">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7865-7880"><rb>道</rb><rt>みち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7880-7883">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7883-7895"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7895-7910">ちひしいで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7910-7922"><rb>驅</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7922-7925">け</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7925-7940"><rb>通</rb><rt>とほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7940-7994">る。それあぶない、とよけるあとから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7994-8009"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8009-8018">ぐわら</seg><choice source="#source-8018-8024"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-8024-8027">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8027-8039"><rb>鳴</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8039-8045">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8045-8057"><rb>來</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8057-8081">る。どしん、づん</seg><choice source="#source-8081-8087"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-8087-8099">づづんと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-8099-8114"><rb>響</rb><rt>ひゞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-8114-8122">く。</seg></p>
