      <p>「あゝ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22202-22217"><rb>默</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22217-22220">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22220-22235"><rb>默</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22235-22253">り。――あの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22253-22277"><rb>高橋</rb><rt>たかばし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22277-22280">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22280-22292"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22292-22295">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22295-22316"><rb>汽船</rb><rt>きせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22316-22319">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22319-22343"><rb>大變</rb><rt>たいへん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22343-22346">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22346-22370"><rb>混雜</rb><rt>こんざつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22370-22397">ですとさ。――この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22397-22424"><rb>四五年</rb><rt>しごねん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22424-22448"><rb>浦安</rb><rt>うらやす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22448-22451">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22451-22466"><rb>釣</rb><rt>つり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22466-22484">がさかつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22484-22502"><rb>沙魚</rb><rt>はぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22502-22517">がわいた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22517-22532"><rb>鰈</rb><rt>まこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22532-22535">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22535-22550"><rb>入</rb><rt>はひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22550-22562">つたと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22562-22583"><rb>乘出</rb><rt>のりだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22583-22595">すのが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22595-22619"><rb>押合</rb><rt>おしあひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22