="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53158-53176"><rb>徑</rb><rt>こみち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53176-53185">はその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53185-53200"><rb>端</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53200-53203">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53203-53215"><rb>縫</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53215-53230">つてゐる。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53230-53245"><rb>雨</rb><rt>あめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53245-53263">のなごりか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53263-53275"><rb>棄</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53275-53278">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53278-53293"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53293-53299">か、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53299-53314"><rb>蘆</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53314-53317">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53317-53329"><rb>根</rb><rt>ね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53329-53353">はびしよびしよと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53353-53365"><rb>濡</rb><rt>ぬ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53365-53371">れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53371-53386"><rb>動</rb><rt>うご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53386-53395">いて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53395-53419"><rb>野茨</rb><rt>のいばら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53419-53422">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53422-53437"><rb>花</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53437-53440">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53440-53455"><rb>白</rb><rt>しろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53455-53458">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-53458-53473"><rb>亂</rb><rt>みだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-53473-53499">れたやうである。</seg></p>
